From 1262627ae0afadd5b8dfe153bf5f33ba15c622e8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mikael Hug <mikaelhug@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 00:51:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Merge prep/hw-test4: the review fixes and hardware branches verified on the mini

Test kernel 4 (7.3.0-bande-00873-g3912d92a8cb9) booted on the j473 and
passed its checks: no WARN, display and greeter, i2c, cpufreq boost, the
MCA sense-frame fix and Wi-Fi. This merges what it carries that
integration does not have yet, with the conflict resolutions recorded in
its merge commits:
review/platform, review/rust, review/gpu, review/display, review/audio,
review/usb, review/wifi, review/smc, review/dt, review/misc,
prep/hw-reboot, prep/hw-usbc-3, prep/hw-display2/3/4 and prep/hw-pm.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UqitcmCNS6G33aQUShi39x

